			<li>Despliegue de Chatwoot como plataforma de atencion al cliente multicanal.</li>
		</ul>
	</article>

	<hr class="exp__divider">

	<h2 class="experience__title">Education & Recognition</h2>

	<article class="exp__item">
		<div class="exp__item__header">
			<h3>Systems Engineering</h3>
			<span class="exp__item__date">2022 &mdash; 2026</span>
		</div>
		<p class="exp__item__place">Universidad Nacional de Trujillo</p>
	</article>

	<article class="exp__item">
		<div class="exp__item__header">
			<h3>Speaker &mdash; AI: Impact & Future</h3>
			<span class="exp__item__date">Aug 2025</span>
		</div>
		<p class="exp__item__place">Colegio de Ingenieros del Peru &mdash; CD La Libertad</p>
		<p>Uso practico de IA para optimizar el ciclo de desarrollo de software y acelerar entregas.</p>
	</article>

	<article class="exp__item">
		<div class="exp__item__header">
			<h3>1st Place &mdash; AYNI Hackathon APEC 2024</h3>
			<span class="exp__item__date">Oct 2024</span>
		</div>
		<p class="exp__item__place">Asociacion de Peruanos en Silicon Valley</p>
		<p>Primer lugar en 'Turismo Inteligente' entre 40 equipos con solucion innovadora para el sector turistico.</p>
	</article>

	<article class="exp__item">
		<div class="exp__item__header">
			<h3>2nd Place &mdash; ONEM &amp; 1st Place &mdash; CONAMAT</h3>
			<span class="exp__item__date"></span>
		</div>
		<p>Olimpiadas nacionales y regionales de matematicas.</p>
	</article>
</section>

<style>
	.experience {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.experience__title {
		color: var(--contrast-text);
		background-color: var(--primary-color);
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 1rem;
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.exp__item {
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-color);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		margin-left: 0.5rem;
	}

	.exp__item:last-of-type {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.exp__item__header {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}

	.exp__item__header h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--primary-text);
		letter-spacing: 0;
	}

	.exp__item__date {
		font-family: "Rosario", sans-serif;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--secundary-text);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
	}

	.exp__item__place {
		font-family: "Rosario", sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--primary-color);
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.exp__item__bullets {
		margin-left: 1.2rem;
		margin-top: 0.25rem;
	}

	.exp__item__bullets li {
		font-family: "Rosario", sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
	}

	.exp__item p {
		font-family: "Rosario", sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	.exp__divider {
		margin: 2rem 0rem;
	}

	@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) {
		.experience__title {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) {
		.experience__title {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
			padding: 1rem;
		}

		.exp__item__header {
			flex-direction: row;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: baseline;
		}

		.exp__item__header h3 {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
